From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Subject: [PATCH] t880: retire completed submissions without saving GOP prefixes

All supported profiles complete pictures without a demand drain. Remove
unused compressed-history storage and prefix resubmission. Retain bounded
outstanding CLIENT/wire ledgers and retire entries only after both compressed
return and picture completion, in either order. Unknown and duplicate tokens
remain fatal.

Explicit EOS still drains and restarts CAPTURE safely; require a new independent
anchor before transferring ownership after EOS. Test delayed completion,
completion ordering, duplicate retirement, bounded outstanding work and long
completed streams without retained compressed history.

